===Noun===
{{en-noun|lines of force}}

# {{lb|en|physics}} An imaginary line in a [[field of force]], whose [[tangent]] at any point gives the [[direction]] of the field at that point and whose [[number]] through [[unit]] [[area]] [[perpendicular]] to the field represents its [[intensity]].

